      "_comment_step": "Stage 2a — syft generates a CycloneDX SBOM of the artifact. The sbom attestor recognises the .cdx.json output and embeds the predicate as https://cyclonedx.org/bom. Because scan-syft ran in a clean directory containing only the artifact, its material/v0.3 tree:materials Merkle root equals build's product/v0.3 tree:products root — this is the v0.3 BackRef graph spine that lets verify discover the build envelope from the scan envelope.",
      "name": "scan-syft",
